# --- stage 3.2: NPT at 300 K, barostat target 1000 atm, held
#     125 ps (stepped decompression 5000 -> 1000 -> 100 -> 1 atm,
#     Pdamp 25000 fs - deliberately ~25x the liquid-typical 1 ps, a
#     very weak barostat: the volume must still grow ~25% to the model's
#     own equation of state, and the 2026-10-19 failure was box-dynamics
#     overshoot at Pdamp 2 ps, so the box is made quasi-static).
#     Each ~5x pressure step keeps the per-stage volume excursion small; the 300 K liquid re-wets the frozen tube between steps (each dilation by dilate mobile opens a thin sleeve at the un-rescaled tube, which the liquid closes again before the next step).
unfix           thb
unfix           thl
unfix           thla
fix             thb bodies rigid/nve molecule langevin 300 300 1000 5101401
  1826 rigid bodies with 20586 atoms
fix             thl li nph iso 1000 1000 25000 dilate mobile
fix             thla li langevin 300 300 1000 5101402
run             ${nbaro2}
run             125000
